{"unit_id":"lloggc-Dante__dsh-conversation-manager#card-zh","repo":"lloggc-Dante/dsh-conversation-manager","commit":"4b280a428c38a2d171ce4c1ab9c362760975c5ab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Conversation Manager 是一款面向 DSH 网页端的会话管理插件，在侧栏会话菜单和页面浮层中加入删除操作。它通过宿主路由删除会话目录和投影缓存，并同步清理工作区、归档及置顶列表。用户可以从单个会话的更多菜单删除，也可以勾选多个会话后确认批量删除；界面提供删除状态、失败提示和列表更新处理。适合需要清理 DSH 本地会话记录的网页端用户。无需 API Key 或外部服务，数据目录可由 DSH_HOME 指定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:512-617","client.js:1185-1263"]}
{"unit_id":"lloggc-Dante__dsh-conversation-manager#card-en","repo":"lloggc-Dante/dsh-conversation-manager","commit":"4b280a428c38a2d171ce4c1ab9c362760975c5ab","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Conversation Manager adds single and bulk session deletion to the DSH web sidebar. It removes local session and cache records, updates workspace listings, and reports failures. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:512-617","client.js:1185-1263"]}
